/-! # Cand20: a 3-element countermodel

Generated by `soup.lean_cert` from tables that `soup.check_offline.check_finite` accepted.
Source: `work/check/profile_candidates.json (smallest non-degenerate model, candidate 20)`.

Laws of the theory (· = `f`, ∘ = `g`):
- `x · (y ∘ x) = x`
- `x ∘ ((x ∘ y) · y) = x`
- `x ∘ ((x · y) ∘ x) = x`
- `x · ((y ∘ y) ∘ (y · x)) = x`

Claims refuted:
- `x · y = x`
- `x · y = y`
